WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.710
Dave: The notes say it needs more salt.

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:05.270
Rubble: The notes are wrong. It needs more chicken.

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.290
Dave: Every recipe doesn't need more chicken.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.230
Rubble: Every recipe needs more chicken.
